# Satellites — descriptive history

## All the descriptive data + full history

```
SatCustomer
  customer_hk    FK → parent hub
  load_date      part of the PK
  hash_diff      hash of attributes (change detection)
  name, email, segment, city, region, country …
```
- PK = **(customer_hk, load_date)** → **many rows per parent, one per point in time**

## History is built in

- Ana Madrid → Barcelona = **insert** a new row; old row **stays**
- Native **SCD-2** — `load_date` sequencing gives versions free

## Two kinds

- **On a hub** → descriptive context (`SatCustomer`, `SatProduct`)
- **On a link** → transaction measures (`SatSalesMeasures`)

## Split by **source** or **rate of change** → parallel loads
